\description{
Set Figure export options: size, frame, background, fonts, title and axis labels, axes, legend, preview, what Export downloads; only those given change, nothing is exported.
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{figure-export.set} (Settings). It changes what the viewer shows: one step of the viewer's history, labelled as R's, undone like any other. The state it can change: \code{settings}.
}
